  "rationale": "The feasible Pareto front is well-established with 9 distinct designs covering the trade-off space effectively. The minimum area point (1034 LUTs+FFs) comfortably meets the throughput constraint (124 MSPS >> 1 MSPS) and accuracy constraint (10.7 bits > 10 bits required). The front extends to 14.7 bits accuracy, providing a clear trade-off curve for the selection rule (min luts_plus_ffs). Hypervolume is 1226 against a reference of 1500, indicating good coverage. Since this is the final round, the current front is sufficient for selecting the final design, which will be the 1034 LUTs+FFs pipelined_m design."
}
